^{:go/end 281} (go/method initL3Table "ARM Architecture Reference Manual ARMv8, for ARMv8-A architecture profile\nD5.3.2 ARMv8 translation table level 3 descriptor formats.\n" [^{:tag (* mmuMap)} m ^int entry ^uint64 base ^uint64 section]
